STRING SLICING 

String slicingis extracting a portion of a string or workin with only a specific part of it.
string [start:stop]
start is inclusive, whilst stop is exclusive
my_str = 'Hello World' 
print(my_str[1;4])  #ell
NOTE slicing does NOT modify original string 

STEP
The step parameter allows you to specify the increment between eac index in the slice.
string[start:stop:step]
my_str = 'Hello World' 
print(my_str[0:11:2]) #Hlowrd 
